# Bloomberg exports stay with the private data estate. Keep the explicitly
# documented synthetic fixture so a clean clone retains one runnable example.
soft/data/bloomberg/*.csv
!soft/data/bloomberg/walmex.csv

# Historical local handoffs and corpus-derived research labels are retained in
